# Arctic Thunder (4D570002): one route for every run (no profile step and
# nothing is saved before the race). PLAYED by nav.py on the Thor,
# 2026-09-27 14:39 PDT (lane.titleroutes HELD session
# arctic-thunder.first-run-20260927T143956).
#
#   the "Snowmobile Renegades" intro video (START ends it) -> the title
#   menu, START / OPTIONS (A) -> SELECT GAME MODE, cursor on RACE (A) ->
#   PLAYER SELECT (A joins player 1; stick down to DONE; A) -> SELECT A
#   DRIVER, Agent 5 (A) -> the track (A) -> load -> the race: position 8 of
#   8, a checkpoint countdown and the race clock.
#
# On PLAYER SELECT the hat does nothing; the left stick moves to DONE.
# A spare A there is what the third A of the nav session was.
#
# Player control: A is the throttle (RT is not). With A held the sled left
# the start line, reached the first ramp and passed the first checkpoint
# (nav frames 012-m11 -> 014-gas -> 016-played, "CHECK POINT", race clock
# 00:53.82). 14-26 fps.
#
# The pattern holds A, steers a little each way, and lets A go for 0.2 s
# each round, so that A is also PRESSED: a held button alone would not
# answer a results or continue screen when the race or its countdown ends.
#
# NOT yet replayed.
wait 50.8
shot boot
wait 9.9
press START 300
wait 7.1
shot title
wait 11.0
press A 300
wait 6.1
shot m1
wait 11.3
press A 300
wait 5.1
shot m2
wait 1.8
press A 300
wait 5.1
shot m3
wait 1.8
press A 300
wait 8.3
shot m4
wait 16.4
axis HATY max
wait 0.4
axis HATY mid
wait 1.6
shot m5
wait 1.2
shot m6
wait 12.8
axis LY max
wait 0.4
axis LY mid
wait 1.6
shot m7
wait 1.8
press A 300
wait 5.1
shot m8
wait 11.4
press A 300
wait 6.1
shot m9
wait 1.7
press A 300
wait 10.4
shot m10
wait 10.9
shot m11
wait 11.3
axis RT max
wait 5.8
shot rt
wait 1.0
axis RT min
wait 0.2
hold A
wait 3.1
shot gas
wait 16.3
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    hold A
    axis LX min
    wait 0.4
    axis LX mid
    wait 2
    axis LX max
    wait 0.4
    axis LX mid
    wait 2
    release A
    wait 0.2
}
